        fix: b"Run a `try:` line (TARGET as FILE:LINE, one region), or add --all to resolve every one the \
            same way.",
        example: b"error conflict.ambiguous: 2 conflict regions match 'shapes.vl': shapes.vl:10, \
            shapes.vl:25; give FILE:LINE, or --all for every one\ntry: volec edit resolve shapes.vl:10 --ours",
    },
    Explain {
        code: b"conflict.format", severity: b"error, exit 1",
        means: b"A file's conflict markers do not make regions: a `<<<<<<<` line without its `=======` \
